ion to enemies hit for 7 seconds, refreshing on basic attacks and subsequent applications and stacking up to 3 times.","The third stack consumes them all to deal 35 : 180 (based on level) (+ 60% AP) bonus true damage."]}]},{"slot":"Q","variants":[{"name":"Plasma Fission","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[80,120,160,200,240],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[90,90,90,90,90],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Slow Duration","modifiers":[{"values":[1,1.4,1.8,2.2,2.6],"units":[" seconds"," seconds"," seconds"," seconds"," seconds"]}]},{"attribute":"Mana Restored per Kill","modifiers":[{"values":[20,22.5,25,27.5,30],"units":["","","","",""]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Mana Restored","modifiers":[{"values":[60,67.5,75,82.5,90],"units":["","","","",""]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Recast: Vel'Koz splits the bolt in two over 0.25 seconds, each part firing perpendicularly in opposite directions and applying the same effects to enemies hit."]}]},{"slot":"W","variants":[{"name":"Void Rift","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[30,50,70,90,110],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[20,20,20,20,20],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[45,75,105,135,165],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[25,25,25,25,25],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Total Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[75,125,175,225,275],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[45,45,45,45,45],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["Vel'Koz periodically stocks a Void Rift charge, up to a maximum of 2."]}]},{"slot":"E","variants":[{"name":"Tectonic Disruption","rows":[{"attribute":"Magic Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[70,100,130,160,190],"units":["","","","",""]},{"values":[30,30,30,30,30],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"MAGIC_DAMAGE","effects":["If Tectonic Disruption is cast in close proximity of Vel'Koz, the anomaly will also slightly knock back enemies hit in the direction of the cast."]}]},{"slot":"R","variants":[{"name":"Life Form Disintegration Ray","rows":[{"attribute":"Damage Per Tick","modifiers":[{"values":[34.62,48.08,61.54],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[9.62,9.62,9.62],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]},{"attribute":"Maximum Damage","modifiers":[{"values":[450,625,800],"units":["","",""]},{"values":[125,125,125],"units":["% AP","% AP","% AP"]}]}],"damageType":"OTHER_DAMAGE","effects":["Passive - Researched: Applying 3 Deconstruction stacks to an enemy champion marks them as Researched for 7 seconds, refreshing on basic attacks and ability hits against them.","Active: After a 0.2-second delay, Vel'Koz channels for up to 2.6 seconds to project an energy beam, during which he can steer the beam in the target direction. Life Form Disintegration Ray can be recast after 1 second during the channel, and does so automatically after the duration.","Recast: Vel'Koz ends Life Form Disintegration Ray."]}]}],"formulaVersion":"15.15.1","history":[{"patch":"25.18","date":"2025-09-09","articleDate":"2025-09-09","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-25-18-notes/#patch-velkoz","changes":[{"slot":"E","title":"E - 지각 붕괴","text":"재사용 대기시간 : 14/13.5/13/12.5/12초 ⇒ 12/11.5/11/10.5/10초","kind":"buff"},{"slot":"R","title":"R - 생물 분해 광선","text":"기본 피해량 합계 : 450/625/800 ⇒ 450/700/925","kind":"buff"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"14.22","date":"2024-11-05","articleDate":"2024-11-05","url":"https://www.leagueoflegends.com/ko-kr/news/game-updates/patch-14-22-notes/#patch-velkoz","changes":[{"slot":"E","title":"E - 지각 붕괴","text":"재사용 대기시간 : 16/15/14/13/12초 ⇒ 14/13.5/13/12.5/12초","kind":"buff"},{"slot":"R","title":"R - 생물 분해 광선","text":"재사용 대기시간 : 120/100/80초 ⇒ 100/90/80초","kind":"buff"}],"section":"챔피언","isHotfix":false},{"patch":"14.1","date":"2024-01-09","articleDate":"2024-01-09","url":"https://